# A planted ledger: the guard function __cxa_guard_acquire with the mark ratchet.
format 1
rule artifact-symbols
configuration planted kind planted
configuration planted tier planted
@build/libcrucible.a | allow | 1 | __cxa_guard_abort@CXXABI_1.3 | -
@build/libcrucible.a | ratchet | 1 | __cxa_guard_acquire@CXXABI_1.3 | -
@build/libcrucible.a | allow | 1 | __cxa_guard_release@CXXABI_1.3 | -
@build/libcrucible.a | allow | 1 | __gxx_personality_v0@CXXABI_1.3 | -
@build/libcrucible.a | libc-allow | 1 | _Unwind_Resume@GCC_3.0 | -
